{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "c8f79ebbeed4785740ec2f442b650b37b8b85c011c991beace9f40b0f0cef483", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！\n今、レッスンルームに空きってありますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n练习室现在空着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "160b20b4a043e2dd30f11702ece83b7f7059e9c3a063395112da7096919d68d6", "ja": "レッスンルーム？　そうだな、青羽さんに確認して\nみないとだけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "练习室？这我得跟青羽小姐确认一下……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "af9bf372a68fa50b23f585e1c15813d3c37482b16eaab9dc8fc455b1dc6d620e", "ja": "はい、クラリネットの練習をしようと思って！\nこの前は、なぜか披露できなかったので……。", "zh": "嗯，我想练习一下竖笛！\n因为之前不知道为什么没办法表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "152bafcede1460fa8cec80e8642bf005da47bae3cee8c0767b72bbe010c3d8a6", "ja": "ああ……この前は可奈の演奏を聞いて、\n響の家族が集まってきちゃったんだったな。", "zh": "对喔……之前可奈演奏的时候，\n响的家人一听到就聚集过来了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "86429b27aa66b468f853d1eabffe92622bc2045e876e8f6c8268fdb73760974f", "ja": "はい……あの時は大変でした……。", "zh": "是啊……那时候真是不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "d8e10e059128f2420d59576c38d1b933d86b326c23065aa5e1b4178a98c878e2", "ja": "なついてもらえるのは嬉しいんですけど、\nどうせなら私の歌を聞いてほしかったな～。", "zh": "我是很高兴牠们愿意亲近我，但既然要听，\n还是比较希望牠们能听我唱歌～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "60bdf541d70461f98dc5488d8d16abf9f65a945f3b86d694880c98bebf81de54", "ja": "あーっ、そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\n私、いいこと考えちゃいました！", "zh": "啊──对了！{$P$}先生，\n我想到一个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "663cbd975d9812c1583045722612018918c4adf6331fda9e0a4be03423a22d8d", "ja": "いいこと？", "zh": "好主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "3e25cc3e620dbd3cb4fd5c1950d3b03b3db22d2d8af7408fa7cec463df40778c", "ja": "私、楽器じゃなくて歌を練習します！　今度は\n私の歌で、響さんの家族に集まってきてもらうんです！", "zh": "我要从练习乐器改成练习唱歌！\n下次我要用我的歌声让响的家人聚集过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "7331888e3982d05e26b6c3e7c83801559df0f6bfb4d347167557ea5fe16562bb", "ja": "そしたら私も～響さんも～♪\nねこ吉～オウ助～いぬ美も～♪　みんな幸せですよっ！", "zh": "这样一来～我和响～♪\n喵吉～鹦助～汪美～♪大家都会很幸福喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a5d19ac0fb38f45f7b7b363662699c47808104c0af42a0e331c3d78ac3742687", "ja": "そうか。楽器の時とは色々勝手が違うかも\nしれないけど、上手く……いくといいな！", "zh": "这样啊。虽然唱歌和演奏乐器的状况可能不太一样，\n但……祝你一切顺利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0033_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "4c5d27361a22f155e378b716581f20901f8f25f77011ea423836368006bfa9ff", "ja": "はいっ♪　私、頑張りま～す！　レッスンルームに\nれっつごー♪　可奈は歌うよクラリネット～♪", "zh": "是♪我会加油的～！Let's go练习室～♪\n可奈要唱歌啰竖笛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
